OL,3,GNEWSATeam's new strip honours stoma
OL,4,A'hero'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football team's new shirt strip is
OL,7,Fhonouring the journey of a boy with a
OL,8,Fstoma.
OL,10,FJack, from Shotton Colliery, had a
OL,11,Fcolostomy bag fitted after developing
OL,12,Fproblems with his large intestine in
OL,13,F2022 and has been fundraising for those
OL,14,Fwho live with the same condition since
OL,15,Fthen.
OL,17,FEarlier this week Trimdon Under-8s
OL,18,Fsurprised the 11-year-old when they
OL,19,Fannounced their shirt will feature the
OL,20,Flogo of Jack's Stoma Journey.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
